msgid "「十四天，做完一個東西。每天完成一次，就點亮一格。想和做之間，其實可以被拉近一些。」"
msgstr "\"Fourteen days, finish one thing. Complete it once a day to light up a box. The gap between wanting and doing can truly be closed.\""

msgid "© 2026 A Little Wonder • 《04_Story.md》第一章 十四天"
msgstr "© 2026 A Little Wonder • Chapter 01 Fourteen Days"

msgid "「每天完成一次，就點亮一格。一開始沒有什麼特別的感覺，只是每天做一次，像在和自己約定。到了第七天，我開始覺得無聊了，也開始想放棄。可我還是打開它。那一格一格被點亮，讓我覺得自己沒有真的失敗。」"
msgstr "\"Complete it once a day to light up a box. At first there was nothing special, just doing it once daily like a pact with myself. By day seven, I felt bored and wanted to give up. Yet I still opened it. Seeing box after box lit up made me feel I haven't truly failed.\""

msgid "—— 《04_Story.md》第一章 • 十四天"
msgstr "—— Chapter 01 • Fourteen Days"

msgid "「我一直有很多想做的事情。但最後，大部分都只停在『想』。所以這一次，我給自己一個規則：十四天，做完一個東西。每天完成一次，就點亮一格。不是因為我有多堅持，只是因為那一格一格被點亮，讓我覺得自己沒有真的失敗。」"
msgstr "\"I always had so many things I wanted to do. But in the end, most remained just thoughts. So this time, I gave myself a rule: Fourteen days, make one thing. Complete it once a day to light up a box. Not because I was so persistent, but because seeing each box lit up made me feel I haven't truly failed.\""
